OL,3,GNEWSADevon teenager reaches national
OL,4,Abeatboxing finals
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old beatboxer from Devon has
OL,7,Freached the final of the UK's national
OL,8,Funder-18 beatboxing championships after
OL,9,Fimpressing judges with a video
OL,10,Faudition.
OL,12,FSonny, known by his stage name SonnyT,
OL,13,Fwill compete against six other
OL,14,Ffinalists at the championship in
OL,15,FBristol in October.
OL,17,FBeatboxing, which involves using the
OL,18,Fmouth, lips, tongue and voice to create
OL,19,Fdrum beats and sound effects, has been
OL,20,Fa passion for Sonny since primary
OL,21,Fschool.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
