OL,3,GNEWSADevon teenager reaches national
OL,4,Abeatboxing finals
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I saw a couple of videos on YouTube
OL,7,Fwhen I was about nine or 10 and thought
OL,8,Fit was pretty cool, I picked it up from
OL,9,Fthere and ever since I've been doing
OL,10,Fit," he said.
